### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. Register Jan Kowalski to Plan 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/membership-plans/{{plan_id_1}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jan Kowalski",
  "email": "jan.kowalski@test.com"
}
> {% client.global.set("member_id_1", response.body.id); %}

